        <mxCell id="a_note_security" value="Implemented boundary&lt;br/&gt;- Token maps to server-side identity + entitlements.&lt;br/&gt;- ALL required scopes; explicit admin-only wildcard.&lt;br/&gt;- tools/list filtered; registry/repository/routes/fallback re-check.&lt;br/&gt;- Risk remains metadata; provider query pushdown is Phase 2." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
