        <mxCell id="a_note_failure" value="Failure and audit semantics&lt;br/&gt;- Over-budget plan: no tool call or synthesis.&lt;br/&gt;- Failed observation: no synthesis or context commit.&lt;br/&gt;- Synthesis/source/policy/CAS failure preserves prior state.&lt;br/&gt;- Child + parent audit is local best-effort.&lt;br/&gt;- Redis distributed CAS and durable SIEM remain targets." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
