        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a_note_llm" value="LLM boundary&lt;br/&gt;- Data class is a trusted env declaration.&lt;br/&gt;- Direct vendor hosts are blocked; positive host allowlist is target work.&lt;br/&gt;- Configured proxy is not proof of Bank A approval/mTLS.&lt;br/&gt;- PII token vault; app-side controlled restoration.&lt;br/&gt;- Strict JSON + code-owned sources.&lt;br/&gt;- Entity-scoped identity/contact/date/money/rate grounding; product KB remains target." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
